<!--
  Leadership feature chrome strings (Overview / Overdue / Reschedule screens).
  All visible static UI labels, titles, and section headers are localized.
  Backend-provided dynamic data (goat counts, shed names, vaccine names, park codes,
  dates, status labels from the backend response) are NOT localized here — they flow
  through the UiState fields.
-->
